§ `s 3`

#ASSERT `the term excludes or restricts misrepresentation liability or remedies` `a clause excluding all liability for statements made before the contract`
#ASSERT `the term excludes or restricts misrepresentation liability or remedies` `a clause capping damages for misrepresentation`
#ASSERT `the term excludes or restricts misrepresentation liability or remedies` `a clause taking away the right to rescind for misrepresentation`
#ASSERT NOT `the term excludes or restricts misrepresentation liability or remedies` `a clause fixing the delivery date`
#ASSERT NOT `the term excludes or restricts misrepresentation liability or remedies` `a clause choosing the governing law`

#ASSERT NOT `the term has effect` `a clause excluding all liability for statements made before the contract` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the term has effect` `a clause capping damages for misrepresentation` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the term has effect` `a clause taking away the right to rescind for misrepresentation` FALSE
#ASSERT `the term has effect` `a clause fixing the delivery date` FALSE
#ASSERT `the term has effect` `a clause choosing the governing law` FALSE
#ASSERT `the term has effect` `a clause excluding all liability for statements made before the contract` TRUE

